│project               this side               other side              link
│beta                  both ways               both ways               linked both ways
│
│mini · paired server, linked · its user sets its side of each link
│  acme-api            both ways, ask first    linked back both ways   mini decides its side
│
│nas · paired server, offline · its user sets its side of each link
│  media               —                       their side unknown      nas decides its side
│  old                 send only               refuses ours            nas decides its side
│
│A link here is set on both sides at once: send here is receive there. With a paired server's project only this side is set, asking first; that server's user sets the other (tm project link there); R asks them to, and the answer shows in the other side's column. Ask first holds each message this coordinator sends on the link until you approve it in the Messages tab. Files (F) sent with a message wait for your accept in the Messages tab, unless set to auto; off takes and sends none.
